# Gitignored files a fresh worktree needs, copied from the main checkout.
# .gitignore syntax. Claude Code applies this to worktrees it creates;
# `bin/xms-task` applies it to script-created worktrees under .tasks/.
#
# NOTE: the generated build files (CMakeLists.txt, conanfile.py, build.py,
# xms_conan2_file.py, _package/pyproject.toml, .flake8) are deliberately NOT
# listed here. They are derived from build.toml by `xmsconan_gen build.toml`
# and must be regenerated in the worktree — copying them goes stale the moment
# a task branch edits build.toml.

# Local Conan / CMake configuration.
# conan_profiles/ is NOT listed: it is generated from build.toml by
# `xmsconan_gen` (see xmsconan_profiles), so copying it would ship a stale
# copy into the worktree instead of regenerating it.
CMakePresets.json
CMakeUserPresets.json
**/CMakeUserPresets.json
.envrc

# Local Claude config. Scoped to the single file on purpose — listing
# `.claude/` wholesale would drag in .claude/worktrees/ recursively.
.claude/settings.json
CLAUDE.local.md
